<title>UK: Turk Garanti Bankasi unit sets $115 million FRN.</title>
<headline>Turk Garanti Bankasi unit sets $115 million FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GRANTOR TRUST 1997-A</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  T. GARANTI BANKASI A.S.</p>
<p> AMT	  $115 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +200 BP   PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.70676  FULL FEES   1.125</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS     MIN 100K  SALE LIMITS US/GB/TR</p>
<p> NOTES	LONG FIRST COUPON TO 15.JUL.97.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
